      "model.prompt": "References: Follow the blocking, camera path, speed and timing of @video_1 exactly. @image_1 defines [WHO OR WHAT IMAGE 1 SHOWS]. @image_2 defines [WHAT IMAGE 2 SHOWS]. Use @audio_1 as the soundtrack.\n\nSummary: [ONE OR TWO SENTENCES: THE TAKE, ITS LENGTH, WHAT THE CAMERA DOES, HOW IT ENDS].\n\nSubject: [WHO IS IN THE SHOT AND WHAT THEY WEAR, FROM THE IMAGES].\n\nCamera path and sync (single continuous shot, no cuts):\n[ONE LINE PER MOVE FROM CANVAS BRIEF, e.g. \"0-1.2s: Wide shot, pushing in slowly.\" \"1.2-1.5s: Hold.\"]\n\nCamera: Exactly replicate the camera trajectory, speed, heights, distances and roll of @video_1. No cuts, no fades, no speed ramps or zooms that are not in @video_1.\n\nStyle: [THE LOOK, MATCHING THE IMAGES].\n\nAudio: [WHAT IS HEARD AND WHEN].\n\nConsistency: [WHAT MUST STAY THE SAME FROM EVERY ANGLE]. No subtitles, no on-screen text, no watermark.",
      "model.resolution": "720p",
      "model.ratio": "9:16",
      "model.duration": 10,
      "model.generate_audio": true,
      "model.task_type": "reference",
      "model.output_format": "mp4",
      "model.auto_downscale": true,
      "model.auto_upscale": true,
      "seed": 1,
      "watermark": false,
      "model.reference_images.image_1": [
